Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.34,0:00:06.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SNIFFS]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.55,0:00:08.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Smell that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.55,0:00:08.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}闻到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.01,0:00:11.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's the smell of new comic books.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.01,0:00:11.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是新漫画书的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.97,0:00:15.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.97,0:00:15.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喔 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.52,0:00:18.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're on me today, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.52,0:00:18.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天我请客 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:22.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're paying? Have you been selling your sperm again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你付钱？你又在卖精子了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.11,0:00:24.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm celebrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.11,0:00:24.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是 我是在庆祝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.90,0:00:28.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As we speak, the space shuttle is docking at the International Space Station...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.90,0:00:28.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在我们说话的同时 太空梭正停靠在国际空间站
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:33.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...where it will deploy the Wolowitz Zero-Gravity Waste Disposal System.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它要去装上 沃洛维茨无重力废弃物处理系统
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.45,0:00:36.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, get over yourself. It's a high-tech toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.45,0:00:36.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}少自我膨胀了 只不过是个高科技马桶而已
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:39.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just think, thanks to your hard work...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:39.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想想看 由于你的努力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.79,0:00:45.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...an international crew of astronauts will boldly go where no man has gone before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.79,0:00:42.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不同国籍的太空人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.54,0:00:45.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}将会勇敢的上到没有人去过的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Is that supposed to be funny? -I believe it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这是笑话吗？ -我相信的确是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:50.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Star Trek reference and the play on words...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:50.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}引述《星舰迷航》并且玩弄词汇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.51,0:00:52.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...involving the double meaning of "to go"...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.51,0:00:52.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}提到了去和上的双重意义
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.59,0:00:56.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...suggest that Leonard is humorously mocking your efforts in space plumbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.59,0:00:56.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}表示莱纳德幽默地嘲弄 你在太空水管事业的努力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:01:00.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, make your little jokes. But of the four of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:01:00.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 尽管开玩笑吧 但我们四个人之中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.27,0:01:04.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'm the only one making any real-world contribution to science and technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.27,0:01:04.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是唯一对真实世界的 科技和科学有贡献的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.56,0:01:07.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's right. This is an important achievement for two reasons:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.56,0:01:07.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说的对 这项成就有两点重大理由
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.53,0:01:09.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Number one, and of course, number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.53,0:01:10.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一号 当然还有二号
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.90,0:01:12.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LAUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.57,0:01:14.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.57,0:01:14.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.53,0:01:18.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Playing on the use of cardinal numbers as euphemisms for bodily functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.53,0:01:19.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把数字和身体功能的委婉用词 联想在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.54,0:01:19.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.21,0:01:25.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here, Sheldon. I pulled the new Hellboy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.21,0:01:25.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拿去 谢尔顿 我帮你保留了最新的《地狱男孩》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.75,0:01:27.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's mind-blowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.75,0:01:27.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}非常惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.42,0:01:30.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, spoiler alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.42,0:01:30.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 剧情泄露警告
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:32.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I didn't spoil anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:32.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有泄露剧情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.97,0:01:36.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You told me it's mind-blowing, so my mind is going into it pre-blown.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.97,0:01:36.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说了它很惊人 当我看的时候已经准备要吃惊了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.35,0:01:40.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And once a mind is pre-blown, it cannot be re-blown.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.35,0:01:40.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当已经准备要吃惊 就没办法真正吃惊了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.81,0:01:43.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm sorry. -Said the Grinch to Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.81,0:01:43.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对不起 -就像格林奇和圣诞节一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:50.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, can I talk to you about something? -Sure. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:50.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 我能不能问你一件事？ -当然 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.44,0:01:52.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remember I went out with Penny a couple weeks ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.44,0:01:52.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记得我几周前和佩妮出去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.15,0:01:55.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah, vaguely. -Sure, you remember. That was the night...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.15,0:01:55.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对 好像记得 -你当然记得 那天晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.99,0:02:00.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you went to the bar and made a fool of yourself trying to pick up strange women.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.99,0:02:00.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跑去酒吧想泡一个怪女人 结果出了丑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.87,0:02:04.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.87,0:02:04.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:08.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, the thing is, the date didn't go that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:08.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那次约会结果不是很好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.29,0:02:11.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Too bad. You know--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.29,0:02:11.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.55,0:02:14.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess the thing to do now is, you know, pick yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.55,0:02:14.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想现在你也只能 从挫折中重新站起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.43,0:02:16.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dust yourself off, forget it. Move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.43,0:02:16.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拍拍身上灰尘 忘掉它 继续生活
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.39,0:02:19.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I can't do that. -Why the hell not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.39,0:02:19.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不能这么做 -为什么不能？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.72,0:02:22.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because we're going out again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.72,0:02:22.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我们明天又要一起出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:23.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, Stuart?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:23.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 斯图尔特？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:25.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Have you read the new Flash? -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:25.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你有没有看过新的《闪电侠》？ -没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.35,0:02:28.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I have, and it will knock your socks off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.35,0:02:28.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我读过 会让你大吃一惊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:31.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good luck getting them back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:31.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.24,0:02:38.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, I figure this is probably my last shot with Penny...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.24,0:02:38.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想这是我和佩妮的最后一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:41.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...and I don't wanna screw it up. -Oh, nobody wants that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:41.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不想要搞砸 -没有人会想搞砸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.33,0:02:42.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So here's my question:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.33,0:02:42.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的问题是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.62,0:02:48.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's the second date. You think she'll be expecting things to get physical?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.62,0:02:48.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是第二次约会 你觉得她会不会预期有肢体接触？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.88,0:02:52.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, gee.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.88,0:02:52.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:55.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, my initial reaction is no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:55.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的第一反应是 不会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.09,0:02:59.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, you know, let me think about it and get back to you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.09,0:02:59.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我想想再回答你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.43,0:03:01.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. So you'll give me a call?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.43,0:03:01.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 那你会打电话给我？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.26,0:03:03.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah, or you call me. -Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.26,0:03:03.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 或是你打给我 -太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.35,0:03:06.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or nobody calls anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.35,0:03:06.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是谁也不要打给谁
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.35,0:03:11.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Interesting, Penny's current suitor asking advice from her former suitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.35,0:03:11.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真有趣 佩妮的现任追求者 问前任追求者的建议
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.11,0:03:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, thanks for closed-captioning my pain, Raj.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.11,0:03:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你帮我的痛苦打上字幕 拉吉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:17.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You wanna make sure he gets nowhere with Penny...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:17.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想确保他不会和佩妮有发展
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.11,0:03:21.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...without jeopardizing your friendship with either of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.11,0:03:21.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又不想破坏你和他们两个的友谊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.41,0:03:23.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm listening. -Just tell him...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.41,0:03:23.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我在听 -你就告诉他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.29,0:03:26.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to do everything you've done with her for the last two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.29,0:03:26.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}完全照你过去 这两年所做过的一切去做
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.28,0:03:57.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, Leonard. -Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.28,0:03:57.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 莱纳德 -你好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:03:59.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How's it going? -Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:03:59.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好吗？ -好 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.45,0:04:01.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You? -Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.45,0:04:01.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你呢？ -很好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.49,0:04:04.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, yeah, hey, can I ask you something? -Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.87,0:04:06.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know your friend Stuart?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.87,0:04:06.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道你那个朋友斯图尔特？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.87,0:04:08.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.87,0:04:08.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:11.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, he asked me out again and I said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他又约我出去 我也答应了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.21,0:04:14.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then I started thinking maybe I should talk to you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.21,0:04:14.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后我就在想 或许我该先跟你谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.30,0:04:16.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-About what? -Well, does it bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.30,0:04:16.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谈什么？ -会不会对你造成困扰？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:18.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me going out with one of your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:18.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟你的朋友出去？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.72,0:04:23.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Because, you know, you and me-- -No. No, that's the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.72,0:04:23.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-因为 你和我… -不 不会 那都过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:25.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm really more of a right now kind of guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:25.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是个把握现在的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.43,0:04:27.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, living in the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.43,0:04:27.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道 活在当下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.23,0:04:31.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Although I do have to live a little in the future because, well, that's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.23,0:04:31.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然我也算是有点活在未来 因为我的职业
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.40,0:04:36.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course, my fondness for classic science fiction does draw my attention backwards...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.40,0:04:36.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然我也喜爱经典科幻 让我有点被拉回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.57,0:04:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but those stories often take place in the future, so--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.57,0:04:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但那些故事通常发生在未来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.99,0:04:43.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In conclusion, no, it doesn't bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.99,0:04:43.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结论是 我不会困扰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.99,0:04:47.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, that's really cool of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.99,0:04:47.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 你人很酷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.04,0:04:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Yeah? Well, I wouldn't say cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.04,0:04:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？我不会说很酷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:53.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd just say, "That's Leonard."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:53.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会说〝莱纳德就是这样〞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.88,0:04:56.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, in that case, do you mind giving me some advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.88,0:04:56.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然如此 你能不能给我一点建议？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:04:58.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}About Stuart?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:04:58.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}关于斯图尔特？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.17,0:04:59.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.17,0:04:59.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.80,0:05:03.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's very shy. How do I make him feel more comfortable around me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.80,0:05:03.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他很害羞 我要怎么让他在我身边自在一点？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.43,0:05:07.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, first of all, don't underestimate the value of discomfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.43,0:05:07.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}首先 不要低估不自在的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.35,0:05:11.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Really? -Well, yeah. Stuart thrives under pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.35,0:05:11.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的？ -对 斯图尔特靠压力而成长
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.18,0:05:13.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's why he works in a comic-book store.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.18,0:05:13.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就是他在漫画店工作的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.11,0:05:18.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PHONE RINGING]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:21.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:22.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Stuart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:22.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是斯图尔特
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.07,0:05:24.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PHONE RINGING]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.53,0:05:28.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not going to answer it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.53,0:05:28.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不接电话？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:32.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He wants to talk about Penny. I don't wanna talk about Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:32.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他想谈关于佩妮的事 我不想谈佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.33,0:05:34.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're making an assumption.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.33,0:05:34.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是在猜测
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:38.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Perhaps the comic book store is on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:38.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许是漫画店失火了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.71,0:05:41.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And he needs your assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.71,0:05:41.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而他需要你的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.72,0:05:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would he call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.72,0:05:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那他何必打给我？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:46.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:46.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:49.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And if you don't answer the phone, we can't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:49.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你不接电话 我们就没办法知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.77,0:05:53.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not answering the phone, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.77,0:05:53.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会接电话的 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.23,0:05:55.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PHONE RINGING]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.23,0:05:59.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Answer the phone, Leonard. -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.23,0:05:59.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-接电话 莱纳德 -不要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.61,0:06:01.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PHONE CHIMING]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.03,0:06:03.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There. It went to voicemail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.03,0:06:03.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 转入语音信箱了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:12.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aren't you going to check your messages?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:12.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不听你的留言？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.79,0:06:17.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -You have to check your messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.79,0:06:17.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不要 -你一定要听留言
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:20.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The leaving of a message is one half of a social contract...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:20.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}留言是社会契约的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.46,0:06:23.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which is completed by the checking of the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.46,0:06:23.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}检查留言才能完成这项契约
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.51,0:06:27.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If that contract breaks down, then all social contracts break down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.51,0:06:27.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果这契约被打破了 那所有的社会契约就都瓦解了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:30.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And we descend into anarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:30.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们就会陷入混乱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.64,0:06:34.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It must be hell inside your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.64,0:06:34.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的头脑里一定很痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.60,0:06:38.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At times.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.60,0:06:38.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有时候的确是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.77,0:06:41.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guys, we have a code red.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.77,0:06:41.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 我们有红色警报
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.40,0:06:44.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Code red, the hospital emergency alert? The computer worm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.40,0:06:44.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是医院的红色警报？还是电脑病毒？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.28,0:06:47.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or the cherry-flavored soft drink from the makers of Mountain Dew?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.28,0:06:47.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是激浪汽水生产的樱桃口味汽水？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:50.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was going over the schematics on my Zero-G Toilet...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:50.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在查我的无重力马桶的蓝图
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.04,0:06:54.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I made a teeny-tiny mistake on the specifications for the diverter valve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.04,0:06:54.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我发现转向阀的规格 有个小小的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:56.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How teeny-tiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:56.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多小？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:58.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's gonna fail after about 10 flushes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:58.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}冲水十次后就会故障
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:02.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-But the mission is for six months. -That's the code red.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:02.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-但这次任务长达半年 -就是这个红色警报
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:06.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's kind of like a jack-in-the-box. No one knows exactly when...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:06.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有点像是个玩偶匣 没有人知道什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.47,0:07:10.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but at some point, something way worse than a puppet is gonna pop out of that box.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.47,0:07:10.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但某时某刻会有一个 远比玩偶糟糕的东西跳出来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:13.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you notified NASA?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:13.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你通知航天局了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:16.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You crazy? What am I gonna say? I screwed up your toilet...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:16.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你疯了吗？我要怎么说？ 我把你们的马桶搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.85,0:07:20.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and pretty soon there's gonna be crap floating all over your nice space station?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.85,0:07:20.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很快就会有大便 在你们漂亮的空间站里飘来飘去？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:22.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:22.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你要怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:24.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna figure out how to fix it, then I'll tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:24.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先想出怎么修理它 然后我就告诉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.07,0:07:26.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what do you need us for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.07,0:07:26.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你要我们做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.74,0:07:29.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He can't figure out how to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.74,0:07:29.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他想不出该怎么修理
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:31.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You said you were gonna be supportive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:31.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说你会支持我的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.58,0:07:35.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm trying. But you have to admit, this is pretty damn funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.58,0:07:35.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我尽力了 但你得承认 这很好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:37.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:37.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我同意
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.71,0:07:40.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a juxtaposition of the nature of space exploration...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.71,0:07:40.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是同时列出太空探险的本质
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:44.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...against the banality of a malfunctioning toilet that provides the comic fodder here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以及故障的马桶所产生的喜剧效果
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:45.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:50.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Check your messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:50.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快点听留言
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.85,0:07:58.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, this is an exact duplicate of the Wolowitz Zero-Gravity...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.85,0:07:58.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 这是完全相同的复制品
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.27,0:08:01.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Human Waste Disposal System as deployed on the Space Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.27,0:08:01.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和空间站上的沃洛维茨无重力 人员废弃物处理系统一样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:05.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you mean the Wolowitz Zero-Gravity Human Waste Distribution System?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:05.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不是在说沃洛维茨无重力 人员废弃物分配系统？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.74,0:08:09.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good one, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.74,0:08:09.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说得好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:12.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[FAKES LAUGH]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:14.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真好笑 现在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.53,0:08:14.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's hilarious. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's an approximation of the spare parts available on the space station.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是空间站上大致的一些零件
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.21,0:08:22.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We gotta find a way, using nothing but this, to reinforce this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.21,0:08:22.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们得想办法 只用这些东西 来强化这个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.42,0:08:24.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So the waste material avoids the turbine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.42,0:08:24.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让废弃物不会被旋转的涡轮打中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.50,0:08:27.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You mean, so it doesn't hit the fan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.50,0:08:27.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的意思是以免事情大条？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:35.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I have to say I thought the toilet humor would get less funny with repetition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:35.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得说我原以为 马桶笑话会因为重复而不再好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.14,0:08:40.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apparently, there is no law of diminishing comedic returns with space poop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.14,0:08:40.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}显然太空大便的好笑程度 没有递减效应
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:43.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.27,0:08:46.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, Leonard. -Hey, Stuart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.27,0:08:46.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 莱纳德 -你好 斯图尔特
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:48.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You busy? -Uh--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:48.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在忙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.57,0:08:50.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Classified, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.57,0:08:50.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是机密 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.82,0:08:53.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, it's a regular Manhattan Project.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.82,0:08:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是个普通的曼哈顿计划
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.66,0:08:57.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's up? -Well, tonight's my date with Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.66,0:08:57.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么了？ -我今晚要跟佩妮约会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.54,0:08:59.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And we haven't been able to connect by phone--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.54,0:08:59.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们没办法用电话联络
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.79,0:09:01.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah, I'm sorry. It's been broken. -Or e-mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.79,0:09:01.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对不起 电话坏了 -电子邮件也没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:04.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, that's broken too. Everything's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:04.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 那也坏了 什么都坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.42,0:09:09.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, I was just wondering if you had any last-minute advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.42,0:09:09.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之我希望你给我最后一刻的建议
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.76,0:09:12.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. Well, off the top of my head...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.76,0:09:12.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我一时之间想到的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.93,0:09:16.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you know, I think the most important thing with Penny is to go really slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.93,0:09:16.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}面对佩妮最重要的就是要慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.14,0:09:19.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, glacial.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.14,0:09:19.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说像冰河一样慢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.31,0:09:22.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay. -You know, guys come on to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.31,0:09:22.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 -男生总是常常扑向她
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.48,0:09:25.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...all the time, so you need to, like, set yourself apart, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.48,0:09:25.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得和他们有所区别 懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.15,0:09:27.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Be a little shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.15,0:09:27.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}害羞一点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.90,0:09:31.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And don't make too much eye contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.90,0:09:31.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要常常和她视线接触
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:34.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you know, treat her with, like, cool detachment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:34.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以一种冷酷的疏离感面对她
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.45,0:09:37.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, you know, fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.45,0:09:37.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有 恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.99,0:09:39.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Fear? LEONARD: Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.99,0:09:39.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-恐惧？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:44.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like you're afraid that if you touch her, she'll break.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:44.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像你会害怕一碰到她 她就会碎了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.71,0:09:47.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that plays right into my wheelhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.71,0:09:47.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那正是我的专长
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:51.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good, good. Well, you kids have fun tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:51.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好 很好 祝你们今晚愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.51,0:09:52.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.51,0:09:52.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:54.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is that thing anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:54.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那到底是什么东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.89,0:09:57.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't know what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.89,0:09:57.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不知道这是什么东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:09:59.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -Good, get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:09:59.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不知道 -很好 出去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.06,0:10:06.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Be afraid of Penny. Nice, very crafty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.06,0:10:06.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}害怕佩妮 不错 心机很重
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:11.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It wasn't bad advice. It just wasn't particularly helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:11.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是坏的建议 只是没有什么助益
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.11,0:10:16.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For what it's worth, my mother says that when we deceive for personal gain...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.11,0:10:16.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不论如何 我妈总是说 当我们为了个人利益骗人时
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:18.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we make Jesus cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:18.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}耶稣会为此哭泣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.83,0:10:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, what if we use this two-inch PVC to reinforce the center cross-support?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.83,0:10:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我们用这两寸塑胶管 来强化中央支撑呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.96,0:10:34.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No good. I mean, it might work for the Japanese and the Americans...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.96,0:10:34.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 对日本或美国人或许有用
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.51,0:10:37.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but have you seen the size of the Russians they got up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.51,0:10:37.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你有没有看过俄罗斯人的体型？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:45.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This thing has to hold up against a hearty potato-based diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:45.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这东西必须承受得住 大吃土豆的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.64,0:10:47.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I feel terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.64,0:10:47.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得很糟
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:50.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe if you were helping, you'd feel better about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:50.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你来帮忙 你会让自己感觉比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.32,0:10:54.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I deliberately tried to sabotage Stuart's date with Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.32,0:10:54.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我故意破坏斯图尔特和佩妮的约会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:58.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course you feel terrible. You completely screwed up your karma, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:58.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你当然会觉得很糟 你完全是在造业
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:01.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't really believe in that superstition, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:01.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不可能相信那个迷信吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.12,0:11:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not superstition, it's practically Newtonian.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.12,0:11:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是迷信 那跟牛顿学说一样可靠
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:07.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For every action, there's an equal and opposite reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每个作用力 都会有同等的反作用力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:11.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard pretends to be a friend, and acts like a two-faced bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德假装是个朋友 但表现得像个双面烂人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.01,0:11:16.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Therefore, he is reborn as a banana slug.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.01,0:11:16.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因此他会转世成为香蕉蛞蝓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.47,0:11:22.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's actually a very elegant system. You know, what goes around comes around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.47,0:11:22.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是个很高雅的系统 种瓜得瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:25.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Speaking of what goes around comes around....
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:25.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说到种瓜得瓜…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.10,0:11:27.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.10,0:11:27.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 听着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.35,0:11:30.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Instead of trying to reinforce this structure here...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.35,0:11:30.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除了补强这里的结构
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.27,0:11:32.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...what if we ran another line, bypassed it entirely?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.27,0:11:32.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能不能加一条线路 直接跳过它？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.90,0:11:35.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Won't work. The diameter of the tubing is insufficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.90,0:11:35.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}行不通 管径不够大
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.65,0:11:37.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if we reposition the collection tank?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.65,0:11:37.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我们把收集槽换个位置？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.82,0:11:39.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It won't work. No way to mount it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.82,0:11:39.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有用 装不上去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.62,0:11:41.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's an idea. What if I change my name...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.62,0:11:41.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有个主意 不如我改个名字
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:44.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and go live with my cousin and her husband, Avi, in Israel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:44.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后去和我堂姐和她丈夫阿维 一起住在以色列？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:48.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:48.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那可能有用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:56.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Morning. -Morning. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:56.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-早安 -早 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.30,0:12:01.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing. We just pulled an all-nighter trying to fix a Zero-Gravity pasta maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.30,0:12:01.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事 我们整晚熬夜 想修好一个无重力通心面制造机
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.64,0:12:06.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm gonna make a coffee run. Want any? -No. I have coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.64,0:12:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我要去买咖啡 你要不要？ -不用 我已经有咖啡了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:09.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great, so how'd it go with Stuart last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:09.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好 昨晚和斯图尔特怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:12.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really don't wanna talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:12.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想谈这个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.94,0:12:14.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Right. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.94,0:12:14.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 当然 没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.65,0:12:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, you know, the thing is, before you guys went out...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.65,0:12:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是你们出去之前
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:20.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...I spoke to him and I-- -I said I don't wanna talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:20.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我跟他谈过而… -我说我不想谈这个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.36,0:12:22.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay, I kind of feel res-- -Look, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.36,0:12:22.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 我觉得我得负… -听着 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.62,0:12:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What goes on is none of your business. So just leave it alone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.62,0:12:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我和斯图尔特的事不干你的事 别提了 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.75,0:12:35.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you really want to clean up your karma, go get my freaking latte.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.75,0:12:35.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你想要消除你造的业 就快去帮我买拿铁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.01,0:12:45.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hang on, I think I've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.01,0:12:45.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 我想我有办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.52,0:12:48.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Help me see if we can wedge this piece of PVC behind the support rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.52,0:12:48.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帮我看能不能把这个塑胶管 黏在支撑架后面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.89,0:12:52.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're overestimating the strength of the substructure you're building.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.89,0:12:52.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你高估了你在建造时的结构强度
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.73,0:12:55.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, I know what I'm doing. -If you knew what you were doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.73,0:12:55.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 我知道我在做什么 -如果你知道你在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.02,0:12:59.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...there wouldn't be a space toilet where my coffee table should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.02,0:12:59.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我摆咖啡桌的地方 就不会放着一个太空马桶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.57,0:13:02.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.57,0:13:02.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:06.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you use this instead of the PVC to keep the filter assembly in place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:06.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么你不用这个取代塑胶管 来固定过滤装置？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:09.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because this is not a spare part from the space station.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:09.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为这不是空间站的备用零件
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.50,0:13:13.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is the thing from the pizza box that keeps the lid from touching the cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.50,0:13:13.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是披萨盒子里 不让奶酪碰到盒盖的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.38,0:13:17.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that what that's for? In India, the lid just touches the cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.38,0:13:17.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是为了这个原因？ 在印度 盒盖都直接碰到奶酪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.96,0:13:21.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We also have rampant poverty and periodic outbreaks of cholera...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.96,0:13:21.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们都很穷 也常会有霍乱流行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.18,0:13:23.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so a little cardboard in our cheese is no biggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.18,0:13:23.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以奶酪碰到盒盖也没什么大不了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.89,0:13:27.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Where you going? -Comic-book store.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.89,0:13:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要去哪里？ -漫画店
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.89,0:13:30.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, an excellent idea. I could certainly use a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.89,0:13:30.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好主意 我可以休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:32.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Me too. -You can go to the comic book store...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:32.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我也是 -你们等下就可以去漫画店
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.94,0:13:35.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...when man can once again safely poop in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.94,0:13:35.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要人类可以在太空中安全的大便以后
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.11,0:13:37.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why does Leonard get to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.11,0:13:37.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么莱纳德可以去？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.73,0:13:40.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because he's upset over his situation with Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.73,0:13:40.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为他对佩妮的情况感到沮丧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.15,0:13:43.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And if I have to hear about it again, I'm gonna kick him in his ovaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.15,0:13:43.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我再听到一次我就会踢他的卵巢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.49,0:13:47.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thanks for understanding, Howard. HOWARD: I got your back, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.49,0:13:47.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢你的了解 霍华德 -我帮你撑腰 姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.74,0:13:53.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, I think we've got a prototype ready to test. Hand me that Tupperware.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.74,0:13:53.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 我想我们有原型可以测试了 把那个保鲜盒给我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:56.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That's heavy. -Damn right, it's heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:56.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-很重 -当然很重
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.34,0:13:57.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's my mother's meatloaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.34,0:13:57.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是我妈做的肉饼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:02.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's been testing toilets for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:02.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它已经测试很多代马桶了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:03.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I must say, Howard...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:03.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得说 霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.05,0:14:07.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I think a detailed letter to MIT describing your current circumstances...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.05,0:14:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是写一封详细的信给麻省理工学院 描述你现在的处境
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.72,0:14:10.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...might entitle you to a refund on your Master's degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.72,0:14:10.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许你可以拿到硕士学位的退费
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:17.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, simulated zero-gravity human waste disposal test with meatloaf analog.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:17.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}模拟的无重力人员废弃物处理 以肉饼进行测试
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:21.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:21.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}三、二、一
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:29.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:29.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.87,0:14:32.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you think the problem is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.87,0:14:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得问题出在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.04,0:14:35.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not enough bread crumbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.04,0:14:35.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}面包屑不够多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:45.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, Stuart, I need to talk to you. -Sure, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:45.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 斯图尔特 我得跟你谈谈 -当然 什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I gave you some bad advice about Penny and I want to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}关于佩妮我给了你不好的建议 我想要道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.85,0:14:50.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, your advice was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.85,0:14:50.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 你的建议很好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:52.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It was? -Oh, yeah, going slow really worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:52.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的？ -对 慢慢来真的有用
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.18,0:14:54.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.18,0:14:54.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:57.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Never worked for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:57.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对我就从来没用
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:14:59.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, last night at dinner I did what you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:14:59.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}昨天晚餐我就照你的话做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.02,0:15:02.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I went really slow, I kept my distance...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.02,0:15:02.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我进展很慢 保持距离
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.98,0:15:05.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and two bottles of wine later, we were making out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.98,0:15:05.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喝了两瓶酒以后 我们就在我车上亲热了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.99,0:15:09.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wine? I didn't say to give her wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.99,0:15:09.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}酒？我没说要给她喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.08,0:15:12.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It doesn't matter. That's where it all went to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.08,0:15:12.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无所谓啦 那时一切都毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.66,0:15:14.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}During the kissing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.66,0:15:14.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}接吻的时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.08,0:15:18.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did you do, sneeze in her mouth? I did that to a girl once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.08,0:15:18.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你做了什么 在她嘴里打喷嚏？ 我对一个女生这么做过
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.25,0:15:22.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, everything was good and really hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.25,0:15:22.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是 一切都很好 也很性感
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.34,0:15:25.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I said, "Oh, Penny"...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.34,0:15:25.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当我叫“噢 佩妮”的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.47,0:15:29.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and right where she was supposed to say, "Oh, Stuart" she said...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.47,0:15:29.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她本来该叫“噢 斯图尔特” 但她却说了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.22,0:15:32.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.22,0:15:32.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.73,0:15:38.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard? -That is your name, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.73,0:15:38.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德？ -那不就是你的名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.65,0:15:41.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. No, yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.65,0:15:41.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 不是 对 的确是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.19,0:15:42.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.19,0:15:42.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.94,0:15:45.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That must've been the last thing you wanted to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.94,0:15:45.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那一定是你最不想听到的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:49.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it beats, "You know I'm a dude, right?"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:49.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那总比〝你知道我是男的吧？〞好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.03,0:15:53.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, it was pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.03,0:15:53.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 的确蛮糟糕的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.54,0:15:56.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No doubt, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.54,0:15:56.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.25,0:16:00.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.25,0:16:00.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:03.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...I'm sorry it didn't work out. -Not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:03.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我很遗憾没成功 -不是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:05.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, how about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:05.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 没想到吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.47,0:16:11.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-See you soon. -Yep, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.47,0:16:11.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-待会儿见 -好 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.36,0:16:27.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I understand. Classified. We'll keep it all classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.36,0:16:27.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我了解 机密 我们会保守秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.44,0:16:29.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No one has to know anything about this but you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.44,0:16:29.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除了你我之外没有人知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.07,0:16:31.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's classified?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.07,0:16:31.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么东西是机密？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.53,0:16:34.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard's space toilet. I'll tell you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.53,0:16:34.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德的太空马桶 我等下再告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.66,0:16:40.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, they've deployed our solution. Let's just all hope it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.66,0:16:40.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们已经加装了我们的解决方法 希望会有用
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.50,0:16:42.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't see why I have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.50,0:16:42.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不懂我为什么需要担心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.46,0:16:45.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My career's not hanging in the balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.46,0:16:45.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又不是我的职业有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.47,0:16:53.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That was a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.47,0:16:53.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是个玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.55,0:16:57.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's funny because it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.55,0:16:57.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好笑的原因是因为那是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.98,0:17:03.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, could you pass the soy sauce, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.98,0:17:03.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 酱油递给我好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.56,0:17:06.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm sorry, were you talking to me? -Yeah, I said Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.56,0:17:06.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对不起 你在叫我吗？ -对 我是叫莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.73,0:17:09.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, you did, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.73,0:17:09.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 的确是 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.70,0:17:18.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.70,0:17:18.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是什么东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.91,0:17:20.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meatloaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.91,0:17:20.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}肉饼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:23.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What was it doing on the ceiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:23.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那在天花板上做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.17,0:17:26.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.17,0:17:26.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是机密
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（国际空间站）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.09,0:17:34.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ASTRONAUT [OVER RADIO]: Houston, International Space Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.09,0:17:34.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}休士顿 这里是国际空间站
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.43,0:17:37.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have a little situation up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.43,0:17:37.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们这里有个小状况
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:40.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'd like to make an unscheduled space walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:40.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们想要进行计划外的太空漫游
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.77,0:17:42.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MAN [OVER RADIO]: ISS, Houston...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.77,0:17:42.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}国际空间站 这里是休士顿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.10,0:17:45.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which crew members would be involved in this EVA?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.10,0:17:45.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是哪一个成员要进行舱外活动？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.69,0:17:49.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ASTRONAUT: Houston, we'd all like to step outside for a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.69,0:17:49.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}休士顿 我们全都想到外面去一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.11,0:17:54.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MAN: ISS, I'm afraid we can't authorize that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.11,0:17:54.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}国际空间站 恐怕我们不能允许
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.95,0:17:58.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ASTRONAUT: Houston, this is more of an FYI call.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.95,0:17:58.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}休士顿 其实只是知会你们一声
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.16,0:18:00.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We are basically out the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.16,0:18:00.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们其实已经离开空间站了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.69,0:18:30.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}译者： 杨博
